Getting it to Peeyush

After the push, GitHub prints a "Create a pull request" link. Or go to https://github.com/Peeyush-Nanhe/Drconnect and it'll offer a banner for your new branch. Target Dev on his repo, not main.

Day to day from here

Pull from origin (his, the source of truth), push to fork (yours):

powershell
git fetch origin
git rebase origin/Dev
git push fork staging

Force-push after a rebase, since rebasing rewrites history:

powershell
git push --force-with-lease fork staging